Package: herbivoreTTR
Title: Transparent Functional Models of Herbivore Energetics
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Barry", "Brook", email = "barry.brook@utas.edu.au",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides transparent functional models of herbivore energetics.
    The current version couples a minimal hourly body-energy ledger to a
    one-pool gut-energy buffer. Controlled prescribed ingestion enters the gut,
    a fixed fraction of opening gut energy is released each hour, and released
    energy enters the body reserve against constant maintenance expenditure.
